    <skill>.claude/skills/task-execute/SKILL.md</skill>
    <protocol>Load all knowledge/files before starting; follow task-execute pre-exec checklist; §10 gate (Placement Justification + publish size + conflict-check) at Step 9.5.</protocol>
  </execution>
</task>
